{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And He brought you near.</b> Before all others — and after you, all the sons of Levi with you, for Korah was a son of the son of Kohath, who carried the Ark on the shoulder, unlike the rest of the Levites, who did not carry such holiness. Moreover, he was head of the singers, as is explicit in Chronicles." "<b>And you seek the priesthood as well.</b> From Moses' reply you learn that he was disputing the priesthood."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:18:13.189149478Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}